        {
          "text": " Konye kisekeloto ikiyakia luka Edeke, komwaŋito akekiro, kokienatar inabinoke, aitodol neadakunor anyunyura naka EJAKAIT asurokin iketuŋa, aitodol neamameunor aŋaleun.",
